{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Kumāputtasahāyaka","html":"<article id='thag1.37'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.37 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.37 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Catutthavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Four </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Kumāputtasahāyakattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Kumāputtasahāyaka </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Nānājanapadaṁ yanti, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Some travel to different countries, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vicarantā asaññatā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>wandering undisciplined. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Samādhiñca virādhenti, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>If they lose their meditation, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kiṁsu raṭṭhacariyā karissati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>what will such rotten conduct achieve? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tasmā vineyya sārambhaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>So you should dispel aggression, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Jhāyeyya apurakkhato”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>practicing absorption undistracted. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Kumāputtattherassa sahāyako thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
